    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39171" root="نبث" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَثَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبُثَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبْثٌ</span>; (and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتبث</span></b> , K;)
<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَشَ</span>; (AZ, S, K;) i. e., <i>He dug with the
hand.</i> (AZ, S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَثَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبُثَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبْثٌ</span>, <i>He
took forth,</i> or <i>dug out,</i> dust, or earth, from a well
or a river. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَثُوا عَنِ الأَمْرِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>They searched,</i>
or <i>sought, for,</i> or <i>after, the thing; inquired respecting it; sought for information respecting it;
searched into, inquired into, investigated, scrutinized,</i> or <i>examined, it.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَثَ</span>, [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبُثَ</span></b> ,]
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبْثٌ</span>, (tropical:)  <i>He was angry.</i> (K.)

